entry module=m0
layout L0 kind=Instance name="Filled" constructor=f1 fields=[{key="count" declared={type=undefined|null|number} flags=[IsRequired]}, {key="ratio" declared={type=undefined|null|number} flags=[IsRequired]}, {key="next" declared={type=undefined|null|L0} flags=[IsRequired]}]
